# Sunnmørsalpene and Romsdalen: the alpine fjord mountains from Ørsta and
# Hjørundfjorden (Slogen) past Stranda to Åndalsnes, Romsdalshornet,
# Trollstigen and Eresfjord. Overlaps the Valldal and Reinheimen boxes; much
# of it is fjord, which the N50 sea map lets the engine skip. No official
# boundary, so a box around Kartverket's place names. EPSG:25833 metres, on
# the 2 km tile grid (1710 tiles).
WEST=36000
SOUTH=6912000
EAST=150000
NORTH=6972000
# N50 county files covering the box (Kartverket names), for the no-go areas.
N50_COUNTIES="15_More_og_Romsdal"
